{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/","sessionId":"8a6a1210-f6e6-4cef-8a4f-b47d9ad0e4f5","version":"synthetic","type":"user","uuid":"7a79a079-facb-412a-8482-155c27a861f5","timestamp":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"4つのサービス間で注文イベントを流すメッセージキューが必要。SQS、RabbitMQ、Kafkaを簡単に比べて。"}}
{"parentUuid":"7a79a079-facb-412a-8482-155c27a861f5","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/","sessionId":"8a6a1210-f6e6-4cef-8a4f-b47d9ad0e4f5","version":"synthetic","type":"assistant","uuid":"6549e302-deac-499a-83e9-4c241f67bd7f","timestamp":"2026-01-01T00:00:01.000Z","message":{"id":"msg_synthetic_1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"<synthetic>","content":[{"type":"text","text":"SQSはフルマネージドで、容量計画なしにスケールし、リクエスト単位の課金です。標準キューは順序を保証せず、FIFOキューは保証しますがスループットの上限が低くなります。RabbitMQは自前で運用するか借りるブローカーで、exchangeによる柔軟なルーティングができ、クラシックキューのメッセージはackされると消えます。Kafkaはパーティション分割されたログで、コンシューマーが自分でオフセットを管理し、順序はパーティション内で保証されます。マネージドサービスを使わない限り運用負荷は大きめです。4サービスで中程度の流量ならSQSが最も運用が軽く、Kafkaは高スループットや多数の独立したコンシューマーが必要なときに強みがあります。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
{"parentUuid":"6549e302-deac-499a-83e9-4c241f67bd7f","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/","sessionId":"8a6a1210-f6e6-4cef-8a4f-b47d9ad0e4f5","version":"synthetic","type":"user","uuid":"d49863e9-b9fb-4556-85a6-eb6d0f467f1c","timestamp":"2026-01-01T00:00:02.000Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"顧客ごとの順序保証が必要。"}}
{"parentUuid":"d49863e9-b9fb-4556-85a6-eb6d0f467f1c","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/","sessionId":"8a6a1210-f6e6-4cef-8a4f-b47d9ad0e4f5","version":"synthetic","type":"assistant","uuid":"a4e5c794-3dd3-449c-8c34-38010541c294","timestamp":"2026-01-01T00:00:03.000Z","message":{"id":"msg_synthetic_3","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"<synthetic>","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3つともできます。SQSはFIFOキューで顧客IDをメッセージグループIDにします。Kafkaは顧客IDをパーティションキーにします。RabbitMQは1キュー1コンシューマーで順序が保たれるので、顧客ごとの順序にはconsistent-hashで複数キューに振り分ける構成が必要で、設定が増えます。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
{"parentUuid":"a4e5c794-3dd3-449c-8c34-38010541c294","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/","sessionId":"8a6a1210-f6e6-4cef-8a4f-b47d9ad0e4f5","version":"synthetic","type":"user","uuid":"1f8602c5-c51d-4b44-8ec4-5cde07a86424","timestamp":"2026-01-01T00:00:04.000Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"チームはエンジニア2人で、予算も少ない。"}}
{"parentUuid":"1f8602c5-c51d-4b44-8ec4-5cde07a86424","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/","sessionId":"8a6a1210-f6e6-4cef-8a4f-b47d9ad0e4f5","version":"synthetic","type":"assistant","uuid":"ce28f879-f504-4e0c-8d71-b4c373ca1a6c","timestamp":"2026-01-01T00:00:05.000Z","message":{"id":"msg_synthetic_5","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"<synthetic>","content":[{"type":"text","text":"それならSQS FIFOが有利です。運用するサーバーがなく、費用も使った分だけです。KafkaやRabbitMQを自前で運用すると、2人チームの時間をかなり取られます。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
